Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Nkhokwe-yotetezedwa chatsopano: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault bisa: message kiyi: key.
>> decrypted := vault vumbulutsa: encrypted kiyi: key.

Zotuluka 
lembani: ['Message:'], mzere-watsopano
lembani: message, mzere-watsopano
lembani: ['Decrypted:'], mzere-watsopano
lembani: decrypted, mzere-watsopano.
